<title>UK: TABLE-UK JULY DISTRIBUTIVE TRADES SURVEY.</title>
<headline>TABLE-UK JULY DISTRIBUTIVE TRADES SURVEY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a table of results from the Confederation of British Industry's July distributive trades survey (percentage balances -- difference between number replying positively and negatively to questions):</p>
<p>RETAILING</p>
<p>VOLUME OF ANNUAL SALES REPORTED</p>
<p>-------------------1997-------1996------------------------------</p>
<p>July June May  Apr  Mar  Feb  Jan  Dec  Nov  Oct  Sep  Aug  Jly</p>
<p>+35 +39  +21  +42  +33  +24  +36  +33  +48  +55  +46  +53  +43</p>
